# Design specs (locked)

Full doc: `packages/theme/SPEC.md` · constants: `packages/theme/specs.ts` · CSS contract: `packages/theme/styles/design/_contract.scss`

## Fonts
Theme → font: mercedes/linear=`inter` · porsche=`barlow` · lamborghini=`anton` · ferrari=`archivo` · apple=`albert-sans`. Use `--font-family-sans` / `--font-family-display` only.

## Type scale (defaults)
display-xl 3rem · display 2rem · h1=`--font-size-2xl` 1.5rem · body=`--font-size-md` **0.875rem** · sm 0.8125 · xs 0.75 · body-lg `--theme-body-lg`.  
Weights: display/heading/body via tokens. Body line-height **`--line-height-body: 1.5`**. Admin UI prefers md/sm — not display sizes in tables.

## Spacing (4px scale)
xs 4 · sm 8 · md 12 · lg 16 · xl 24 · 2xl 32. Layout: `--theme-page-pad` 1.5rem · `--theme-section-gap` 1.25rem · `--theme-card-pad` 1rem. No magic margins.

## Radius (theme maps)
mercedes **0** · linear **6md/8card** · porsche 8 · lambo 4–8 · ferrari **2** · apple **11md/14card** (+ pill CTA). Use `--theme-card-radius` / `--theme-btn-radius` / `--theme-input-radius`.

## Cards
`surface-1` + 1px border + `--theme-card-radius` + `--theme-card-pad` + `shadow-sm`. No hero-as-card; no heavy glow stacks.

## Buttons
solid / outlined / text(ghost). Heights `--height-*`. Chrome = ghost/outline; one solid primary CTA in content. Motion ≤ `--transition-normal`.

## Page layout
Inverted-L: sidebar 244/64 · header 48 · tabs 36 · shell 100vh. Page = `ln-page-hero` then grids/tables. Tabs in chrome only; scroll inside content.

## Density
compact=Linear (28/32/36) · comfortable=Mercedes/Porsche/Lambo (32/40/48) · retail=Apple (32/36/44). Default control = md. Don’t mix three heights in one view.

## Hard rules
- Consume semantic CSS vars only (`--ds-*`, `--surface-*`, `--theme-*`, spacing/type/radius tokens).
- Never hardcode hex/radius/font-size in base or business components.
- **Spacing:** toolbar/control gap = `--spacing-md` (12); section gap = `--theme-section-gap`; card pad = `--theme-card-pad`. Never pack controls with 0–4px gaps.
- **Card:** default slot is `.p-card-body` — flex/`gap` on the Card host does nothing. Use built-in body stack, or `__toolbar` / `vp-toolbar` for row toolbars.
- Prefer **modern product / SaaS** surfaces over traditional ERP admin chrome (see `docs/THEME_STUDIO.md`).
- Changing specs: update SPEC.md + specs.ts + theme SCSS + this rule together.
- Custom themes: only via Theme Studio / Token overlay — do not fork locked designmd sources casually.
